  "body": "I had found the \"janitor\" (https://github.com/xwiki-labs/synapse_scripts) repo to do that but as it was strongly advised not to use it I did not. I find the behaviour Telegram has for messages - deleting will immediately hide them from the message log and they are deleted for good - much more appealing.\r\n\r\nHow can I achieve the same behaviour in my homeserver?",
